erday/276330","site":"T Nation · 755 posts · 2021"},{"title":"The 'I HATE Prof X' Thread","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-i-hate-prof-x-thread/152418","site":"T Nation · 574 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Favorite Power Foods","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/favorite-power-foods/288696","site":"T Nation · 414 posts · 2024"},{"title":"bonesmashing is hard to continue with","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-is-hard-to-continue-with.1779398/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251223025741/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-is-hard-to-continue-with.1779398/"},{"title":"bonesmashing results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-results.1777714/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260225151147/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-results.1777714/"},{"title":"bonesmashing isnt cope results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-isnt-cope-results.1772458/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228070141/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-isnt-cope-results.1772458/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1769576/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251227094110/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1769576/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1768378/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218011457/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1768378/"},{"title":"bonesmashing bonesmashing bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-bonesmashing-bonesmashing.1767706/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251217050308/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-bonesmashing-bonesmashing.1767706/"},{"title":"bonesmashing my chin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-my-chin.1766069/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229165913/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-my-chin.1766069/"},{"title":"bonesmashing while on hgh at 14","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-while-on-hgh-at-14.1764760/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251221124047/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-while-on-hgh-at-14.1764760/"},{"title":"bonesmashing heels","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-heels.1764297/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260201072052/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-heels.1764297/"},{"title":"bonesmashing routine","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-routine.1761397/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260226195543/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-routine.1761397/"},{"title":"bonesmashing explanation cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-explanation-cope.1759024/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251224023501/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-explanation-cope.1759024/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1758587/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218024437/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1758587/"},{"title":"bonesmashing infraorbitals","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-infraorbitals.1753340/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260130064701/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-infraorbitals.1753340/"},{"title":"bonesmashing redness","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-redness.1739234/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251231160352/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-redness.1739234/"}],"web":[{"title":"Bonesmashing — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Bone_smashing"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Bone_smashing","lead":["Bonesmashing (also bone smashing or face hammering) is a looksmaxxing practice in which people strike their own facial bones, typically with a hammer or similar object, in the belief that the resulting trauma will remodel the bone into a more defined, \"chiselled\" shape [1]. It belongs to the bonehacks category of looksmaxxing.","Wikipedia describes the practice as rarely carried out and as something of an inside joke, and notes that sources it cites classify it as misinformation [1]. It has nonetheless drawn attention from journalists and surgeons: letters in oral and maxillofacial surgery journals in 2024 described it as a dangerous trend spread on TikTok [2][3], and a 2026 cross-sectional study of social-media discourse recorded thousands of mentions of the term [4]. No clinical study has tested whether it changes facial structure."],"infobox":[["Category","Bonehacks (looksmaxxing)"],["Also called","Bone smashing, face hammering"],["Claimed aim","Remodel facial bone (e.g. cheekbones, jaw, brow)"],["Research status","No clinical studies"],["Expert position","Surgeons warn of fracture and nerve injury [1][2]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Practitioners strike areas such as the cheekbones, jaw or brow ridge with an object such as a hammer [1]. Looksmaxxing itself emerged in the 2010s on forums sometimes grouped as the PSL community, and Wikipedia does not identify where bonesmashing specifically began [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Beliefs and claims","paras":["Proponents argue that bone responds to repeated micro-trauma by thickening or reshaping, and that visible changes in facial features follow. Threads on looksmaxxing forums include before-and-after posts credited to bonesmashing, while other members attribute the changes to puberty or editing [5][6]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Research and expert views","paras":["No published study has measured bonesmashing outcomes in people. Surgeon commentary in the Journal of Stomatology, Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery expresses concern about the trend [2][3], and a 2026 study analysing posts on looksmaxxing and its soft and hard practices found that the term generated 2,518 mentions over twelve months with an estimated social-media reach of 32 million [4].","Facial surgeons cited in coverage summarised by Wikipedia warn of fractures, facial misalignment, neurovascular injury, deformity and changes to vision [1]. A nursing publication also published an article on the risks of the trend [7]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Media coverage","paras":["Wikipedia lists coverage by Vice, The Daily Dot, CBS Baltimore and The Guardian between 2023 and 2024; CBS Baltimore described it as a dangerous TikTok beauty trend that surgeons warn against [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"On looksmaxxing forums, bonesmashing is debated as to whether it works at all, with some members posting claimed results and others attributing them to puberty, angles or editing [5][6].","claims":[{"claim":"Hitting facial bones makes them grow or reshape (\"it works\").","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Visible changes are caused by bonesmashing rather than puberty or other factors.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[{"year":"2023","event":"Media outlets begin covering bonesmashing as a social-media trend [1]."},{"year":"2024","event":"Surgeon letters and a nursing article warn about the trend [2][3][7]."},{"year":"2026","event":"Cross-sectional analysis of looksmaxxing social-media discourse published [4]."}],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Urgent concern regarding \"bone smashing\", a dangerous trend on TikTok","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38278441/","source":"Journal of Stomatology, Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery","year":2024,"type":"study"},{"title":"The bone smashing and the excesses of social networking trends","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38458546/","source":"Journal of Stomatology, Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery","year":2024,"type":"study"},{"title":"Dangerous trends on social media related to facial esthetics: Analysis of looksmaxxing and its softmaxxing and hardmaxxing practices","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42674114/","source":"Journal of Stomatology, Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery","year":2026,"type":"study"},{"title":"Bonesmashing results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-results.2410261/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Bone smashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bone-smashing.2020116/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Risks of 'bone smashing' trend on social media","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38757990/","source":"Nursing","year":2024,"type":"study"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.2431774/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20261002115309/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.2431774/"},{"title":"Bonesmashing results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-results.2410261/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260926141927/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-results.2410261/"},{"title":"Bone smashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bone-smashing.2020116/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260427122458/https://looksmax.org/threads/bone-smashing.2020116/"},{"title":"bonesmashing update glabella went insane in 2 months","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-update-glabella-went-insane-in-2-months.1846247/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260207094834/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-update-glabella-went-insane-in-2-months.1846247/"},{"title":"bonesmashing ascended my eye are from sub 5 to htn","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-ascended-my-eye-are-from-sub-5-to-htn.1827054/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260223140402/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-ascended-my-eye-are-from-sub-5-to-htn.1827054/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1810912/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260221113149/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1810912/"},{"title":"bonesmashing progress gtfih","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-progress-gtfih.1791834/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229145957/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-progress-gtfih.1791834/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1789976/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228153522/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1789976/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1789961/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228152242/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1789961/"},{"title":"bonesmashing asymmetry","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-asymmetry.1788791/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260102063036/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing-asymmetry.1788791/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1788042/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260222033856/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1788042/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1788036/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228192521/https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1788036/"},{"title":"bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bonesmashing.1786772/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251226222159/